{
  "title": "ISic004340. Fragment of a list of names",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: autopsy 2014.09.09</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<span dir=\"ltr\">(vac.1)</span>  <span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Φίλιος\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Φίλιος\">Φίλιος̣</span></span> [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<span dir=\"ltr\">(vac.2)</span> ἀγων̣[οθέται? <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Νικομήδης\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Νικομήδης\">Νικομήδ[ης</span></span>  <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <br id=\"al4-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Νυμφόδωρος\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Νυμφόδωρος\">Ν̣[υ]μφ[ό]δ[ωρος?</span></span>  <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <br id=\"al5-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Τιμ\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Τιμ\"><span data-text=\"Τιμ\">Τ̣ιμ̣</span></span></span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: autopsy 2014.09.09</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]&nbsp;&nbsp; <span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Φίλιος\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Φίλιος\">ΦΙΛΙΟ.</span></span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ΑΓΩ.[......<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Νικομήδης\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Νικομήδης\">ΝΙΚΟΜΗΔ[..</span></span><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Νυμφόδωρος\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Νυμφόδωρος\">.[.]ΜΦ[.]Δ[....</span></span><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<br id=\"al5-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Τιμ\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Τιμ\"><span data-text=\"Τιμ\">.Ι.</span></span></span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2><a href=\"ISic004340_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2014-09-09\" src=\"ISic004340_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic004340.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2014-09-09\" src=\"ISic004340-thumb.jpg\"></a><a href=\"ISic004340_rear_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2014-09-09\" src=\"ISic004340_rear_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic004340_rear.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2014-09-09\" src=\"ISic004340_rear-thumb.jpg\"></a></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span>  <span>Text from autopsy</span>  </span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2> translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\">  </p><p>  </p></div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>The fragment seems most likely to be a list of names in the nominative, with the indented word at line 2 perhaps the title of the office of agonothete (since personal names in Ἀγων- are rare, and the indentation fits better as such a title, in a list. </p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li>forthcoming in Journal of Epigraphic Studies 2027</li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"><p>Widely spaced, neatly cut, regular letters of broad module. Alpha has straight bar; eta is wide; Mu has vertical outer strokes and half-length inner strokes; omicron is small and above the line (6mm); phi has a slightly extended vertical (14mm); omega is full size, circular, and open with horizontal feet.</p> Line 1-4  9-10  Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. </div>",
